flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open NeuroTask]
    B --> C{Existing account?}
    C -- No --> D[Register account]
    C -- Yes --> E[Log in]
    D --> F[Validate input and hash password]
    F --> G[(PostgreSQL: create user)]
    G --> E
    E --> H{Credentials valid?}
    H -- No --> I[Show login error]
    I --> E
    H -- Yes --> J[Load authenticated user workspace]
    J --> K[Create or select assignment]
    K --> L[Submit assignment prompt]
    L --> M[Generate micro-actions using LLM JSON schema]
    M --> N{Valid, atomic steps?}
    N -- No --> O[Use offline heuristic templates / retry]
    O --> P[Build prerequisite dependency DAG]
    N -- Yes --> P
    P --> Q[Save assignment and subtasks for this user]
    Q --> R[Find next unlocked micro-action]
    R --> S{An unlocked step exists?}
    S -- No --> T[Show assignment completion]
    S -- Yes --> U[Display only active step and criteria]
    U --> V[Start focus timer]
    V --> W{User stuck?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Split blocked step into two 5-min actions]
    X --> Y[Log rescue event]
    Y --> R
    W -- No --> Z{Step completed?}
    Z -- No --> AA[Continue / pause focus session]
    AA --> AB[Capture energy rating and distraction tags]
    AB --> V
    Z -- Yes --> AC[Mark step complete]
    AC --> AD[Unlock dependent steps]
    AD --> AE[Log session duration, energy and distractions]
    AE --> R
    T --> AF[Update personal telemetry dashboard]
    AF --> AG[Optionally save assignment blueprint]
    AG --> AH([End / Return to workspace])
